<font color="#FFD54A">Uang tunai sudah diturunkan.</font>

00:01:37.014 --> 00:01:39.348
<font color="#FFD54A">Baik. Ayo kita mulai.</font>

00:01:53.488 --> 00:01:55.239
<font color="#FFD54A">Informannya masih di ruang bawah tanah?</font>

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:56.450
<font color="#FFD54A">Ya, Bos.</font>

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:00.119
<font color="#FFD54A">Itu orang kita, Lubomir.</font>

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:03.498
<font color="#FFD54A">Badannya sebesar truk, jadi mestinya gampang dikenali.</font>

00:02:11.923 --> 00:02:13.342
<font color="#FFD54A">Bangsat!</font>

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:17.763
<font color="#FFD54A">Bangsat! Jangan sentuh aku!</font>

00:02:18.847 --> 00:02:21.766
<font color="#FFD54A">- Katamu kau akan membiarkan kami pergi!
- Dan memang akan.</font>

00:02:21.767 --> 00:02:24.144
<font color="#FFD54A">Kalian cuma umpan.</font>

00:02:25.312 --> 00:02:27.397
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku polisi yang menyamar!</font>

00:02:29.483 --> 00:02:30.733
<font color="#FFD54A">Baik, teman-teman.</font>

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:32.693
<font color="#FFD54A">Kita punya tiga menit. Masuk, keluar.</font>

00:02:32.694 --> 00:02:33.987
<font color="#FFD54A">Tetap waspada.</font>

00:02:43.705 --> 00:02:44.790
<font color="#FFD54A">Polisi!</font>

00:02:47.042 --> 00:02:49.336
<font color="#FFD54A">Tolong! Tolong aku!</font>

00:03:16.113 --> 00:03:17.114
<font color="#FFD54A">Masukkan uang ke tas.</font>

00:03:22.119 --> 00:03:24.621
<font color="#FFD54A">Tidak. Jangan! Kumohon!</font>

00:03:25.622 --> 00:03:26.957
<font color="#FFD54A">Mereka datang untukmu.</font>

00:03:41.763 --> 00:03:43.849
<font color="#FFD54A">Blaze? Jimmy? Hei!</font>

00:10:08.441 --> 00:10:10.651
<font color="#FFD54A">Sapi-sapi jantan ini licik.</font>

00:10:10.652 --> 00:10:14.238
<font color="#FFD54A">Begitu ada sedikit saja tanda ancaman, langsung setrum. Paham?</font>

00:10:14.239 --> 00:10:15.365
<font color="#FFD54A">Nih, pegang.</font>

00:10:16.616 --> 00:10:18.243
<font color="#FFD54A">Pegang. Nanti kau akan membutuhkannya.</font>

00:10:22.497 --> 00:10:24.916
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku tidak mau mati di sini hari ini, Bung.</font>

00:10:33.716 --> 00:10:34.717
<font color="#FFD54A">Baik.</font>

00:10:49.607 --> 00:10:50.692
<font color="#FFD54A">Ayo!</font>

00:10:53.653 --> 00:10:55.363
<font color="#FFD54A">Setrum dia! Ayo. Arahkan ke sana.</font>

00:10:56.531 --> 00:10:58.658
<font color="#FFD54A">Sialan! Setrum dia!</font>

00:11:03.037 --> 00:11:04.247
<font color="#FFD54A">Astaga--</font>

00:11:08.501 --> 00:11:11.128
<font color="#FFD54A">Sudah kubilang, "Setrum dia!" Sialan. Kau sedang apa?</font>

00:11:28.897 --> 00:11:31.440
<font color="#FFD54A">Dua detik lagi aku bisa jadi daging cincang di sana.</font>

00:11:31.441 --> 00:11:33.401
<font color="#FFD54A">Lain kali pakai benda sialan itu.</font>

00:11:45.538 --> 00:11:47.289
<font color="#FFD54A">Hei, Steve.</font>

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:49.124
<font color="#FFD54A">Hei, Pak O'Neill.</font>

00:11:49.125 --> 00:11:51.085
<font color="#FFD54A">Bagaimana memisahkan sapi-sapi jantannya?</font>

00:11:51.961 --> 00:11:54.421
<font color="#FFD54A">Ya, tadi... lancar.</font>

00:11:54.422 --> 00:11:57.591
<font color="#FFD54A">- Ya. Jellef memang butuh waktu untuk terbiasa.
- Ya.</font>

00:11:57.592 --> 00:11:59.843
<font color="#FFD54A">Dokter hewan baru akan datang minggu depan, jadi bersiaplah.</font>

00:11:59.844 --> 00:12:01.386
<font color="#FFD54A">Tapi sekarang aku butuh kau ke ladang tujuh.</font>

00:12:01.387 --> 00:12:03.221
<font color="#FFD54A">- Selesai sebelum matahari terbenam?
- Tentu.</font>

00:12:03.222 --> 00:12:04.557
<font color="#FFD54A">Baik. Terima kasih.</font>

00:13:31.477 --> 00:13:32.645
<font color="#FFD54A">Coba saja.</font>

00:13:33.604 --> 00:13:34.480
<font color="#FFD54A">Lagi murung?</font>

00:13:46.909 --> 00:13:48.244
<font color="#FFD54A">Jadi anak baik hari ini, ya?</font>

00:13:53.332 --> 00:13:56.252
<font color="#FFD54A">Ini sesi ke-52, Steven Bay.</font>

00:13:58.963 --> 00:14:02.174
<font color="#FFD54A">Steven, kau berada di dalam lift</font>

00:14:02.175 --> 00:14:04.677
<font color="#FFD54A">yang turun menuju lantai dasar.</font>

00:14:05.845 --> 00:14:09.348
<font color="#FFD54A">Sekarang aku akan menghitung mundur perlahan, oke?</font>

00:14:09.974 --> 00:14:10.808
<font color="#FFD54A">Kita mulai.</font>

00:14:11.517 --> 00:14:13.019
<font color="#FFD54A">- Sepuluh.
- Sepuluh.</font>

00:14:13.978 --> 00:14:16.105
<font color="#FFD54A">- Sembilan.
- Sembilan.</font>

00:14:16.856 --> 00:14:17.857
<font color="#FFD54A">Delapan.</font>

00:14:19.817 --> 00:14:20.777
<font color="#FFD54A">Tujuh.</font>

00:14:22.528 --> 00:14:23.362
<font color="#FFD54A">Enam.</font>

00:14:25.114 --> 00:14:26.115
<font color="#FFD54A">Lima.</font>

00:14:27.992 --> 00:14:29.159
<font color="#FFD54A">Empat.</font>

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:42.881
<font color="#FFD54A">Kau ada di mana, Steven?</font>

00:14:42.882 --> 00:14:45.342
<font color="#FFD54A">Di Belain, di ladang jagung.</font>

00:14:45.343 --> 00:14:47.094
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku melihat sesuatu.</font>

00:14:47.095 --> 00:14:49.055
<font color="#FFD54A">Warnanya hitam, lalu aku berlari.</font>

00:14:56.687 --> 00:14:58.188
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku berlari sekuat tenaga.</font>

00:15:11.828 --> 00:15:12.912
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku tersesat.</font>

00:15:19.877 --> 00:15:21.504
<font color="#FFD54A">Lalu apa, Steven?</font>

00:15:23.089 --> 00:15:24.298
<font color="#FFD54A">Tolong aku!</font>

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:28.677
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku sendirian.</font>

00:15:31.222 --> 00:15:32.722
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku tidak bisa menemukan jalan keluar.</font>

00:15:32.723 --> 00:15:33.765
<font color="#FFD54A">Tolong!</font>

00:15:33.766 --> 00:15:35.059
<font color="#FFD54A">Jadi aku ketakutan.</font>

00:15:43.901 --> 00:15:44.902
<font color="#FFD54A">Steven,</font>

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:48.864
<font color="#FFD54A">kita kembali ke dalam lift.</font>

00:15:48.865 --> 00:15:52.910
<font color="#FFD54A">Kita akan naik perlahan, lalu saat aku menjentikkan jari,</font>

00:15:54.078 --> 00:15:55.537
<font color="#FFD54A">kau bisa membuka mata.</font>

00:15:55.538 --> 00:15:56.538
<font color="#FFD54A">Dan...</font>

00:15:56.539 --> 00:15:57.622
<font color="#FFD54A">buka.</font>

00:16:01.169 --> 00:16:02.211
<font color="#FFD54A">Apa yang kau rasakan?</font>

00:16:03.754 --> 00:16:07.007
<font color="#FFD54A">Itulah masalahnya, Dr. Harris. Aku sendirian.</font>

00:16:07.008 --> 00:16:10.802
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku merasa bisa mengingat, tapi sebenarnya tidak.</font>

00:16:10.803 --> 00:16:13.180
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku cuma berpura-pura menjadi orang sungguhan.</font>

00:16:13.181 --> 00:16:17.559
<font color="#FFD54A">Jauh di dalam diriku, aku tahu aku sedang berbohong.</font>

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:20.104
<font color="#FFD54A">Bahwa aku bukan orang sungguhan, bahwa aku tidak ada.</font>

00:16:22.857 --> 00:16:23.941
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku tahu itu...</font>

00:16:26.527 --> 00:16:27.528
<font color="#FFD54A">membuat gelisah.</font>

00:16:28.487 --> 00:16:30.447
<font color="#FFD54A">Dokter, aku hanya...</font>

00:16:30.448 --> 00:16:33.201
<font color="#FFD54A">Anda satu-satunya orang yang kupercaya.</font>

00:16:53.095 --> 00:16:55.681
<font color="#FFD54A">Steven, aku ingin menunjukkan sesuatu.</font>

00:16:56.515 --> 00:16:57.516
<font color="#FFD54A">Kemari.</font>

00:16:59.602 --> 00:17:00.603
<font color="#FFD54A">Minyak zaitun.</font>

00:17:02.146 --> 00:17:03.356
<font color="#FFD54A">Dari...</font>

00:17:04.273 --> 00:17:05.274
<font color="#FFD54A">Peternakan Hatcher.</font>

00:17:07.944 --> 00:17:10.738
<font color="#FFD54A">Tomat organik dari...</font>

00:17:12.031 --> 00:17:13.074
<font color="#FFD54A">Peternakan Etruscan.</font>

00:17:14.158 --> 00:17:15.617
<font color="#FFD54A">Ingat?</font>

00:17:15.618 --> 00:17:18.246
<font color="#FFD54A">Kau pernah bekerja musim panas di kedua tempat itu.</font>

00:17:21.916 --> 00:17:23.417
<font color="#FFD54A">Ingatanmu akan kembali, Steven.</font>

00:17:24.794 --> 00:17:25.795
<font color="#FFD54A">Kau akan mengingat semuanya.</font>

00:17:27.546 --> 00:17:28.798
<font color="#FFD54A">Hal seperti ini butuh waktu.</font>

00:17:33.094 --> 00:17:34.219
<font color="#FFD54A">Biar aku yang bayar.</font>

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:35.804
<font color="#FFD54A">Tidak, biar aku.</font>

00:17:35.805 --> 00:17:38.473
<font color="#FFD54A">Tidak, setidaknya aku bisa melakukan ini.</font>

00:17:38.474 --> 00:17:40.101
<font color="#FFD54A">- Kumohon.
- Terima kasih banyak.</font>

00:20:16.799 --> 00:20:18.092
<font color="#FFD54A">Dia lumayan seksi.</font>

00:20:18.926 --> 00:20:19.927
<font color="#FFD54A">Kau kenal dia?</font>

00:20:20.553 --> 00:20:21.554
<font color="#FFD54A">Tidak.</font>

00:20:22.805 --> 00:20:24.515
<font color="#FFD54A">Kalau ada kesempatan, pasti kugoda.</font>

00:20:31.939 --> 00:20:33.607
<font color="#FFD54A">Steven Bay, Gretchen Lowe.</font>

00:20:34.483 --> 00:20:35.443
<font color="#FFD54A">Hai.</font>

00:20:36.068 --> 00:20:37.861
<font color="#FFD54A">Gretchen.</font>

00:20:37.862 --> 00:20:40.738
<font color="#FFD54A">- Hai, aku Steven. Senang bertemu denganmu.
- Senang bertemu juga.</font>

00:20:40.739 --> 00:20:44.284
<font color="#FFD54A">- Aku dokter hewan baru di Sollingers.
- Oke.</font>

00:20:44.285 --> 00:20:46.286
<font color="#FFD54A">Dia akan memeriksa ternak</font>

00:20:46.287 --> 00:20:48.496
<font color="#FFD54A">dan memastikan kita semua tetap waspada di sini, jadi...</font>

00:20:48.497 --> 00:20:50.290
<font color="#FFD54A">Kalian akan sering bekerja bersama.</font>

00:20:50.291 --> 00:20:51.667
<font color="#FFD54A">- Bagus.
- Dia profesional.</font>

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:55.296
<font color="#FFD54A">- Kalau begitu kita mulai dari sapinya.
- Ya. Bagus.</font>

00:20:57.465 --> 00:21:00.801
<font color="#FFD54A">Wah, cantik sekali.</font>

00:21:02.636 --> 00:21:03.846
<font color="#FFD54A">Hai.</font>

00:21:05.473 --> 00:21:09.310
<font color="#FFD54A">Kita akan mengambil sedikit sampel di sini.</font>

00:21:11.645 --> 00:21:13.939
<font color="#FFD54A">Tes singkat saja untuk mendapatkan data awal.</font>

00:21:20.488 --> 00:21:21.363
<font color="#FFD54A">Bisa pegang ini?</font>

00:21:30.331 --> 00:21:32.123
<font color="#FFD54A">Sial. Maaf.</font>

00:21:32.124 --> 00:21:34.084
<font color="#FFD54A">Tidak apa-apa. Kita ulangi.</font>

00:21:35.669 --> 00:21:37.171
<font color="#FFD54A">Steven...</font>

00:21:53.562 --> 00:21:54.688
<font color="#FFD54A">Kau baik-baik saja?</font>

00:21:57.149 --> 00:21:58.150
<font color="#FFD54A">Maaf.</font>

00:22:51.912 --> 00:22:53.288
<font color="#FFD54A">Hai, Steven.</font>

00:22:53.289 --> 00:22:55.164
<font color="#FFD54A">Maaf mengganggu, aku butuh bantuan.</font>

00:22:55.165 --> 00:22:56.250
<font color="#FFD54A">Hei, Beau. Hai.</font>

00:23:00.296 --> 00:23:02.922
<font color="#FFD54A">Mobilku... sepertinya baterainya mati.</font>

00:23:02.923 --> 00:23:04.549
<font color="#FFD54A">Boleh pinjam teleponmu?</font>

00:23:04.550 --> 00:23:06.217
<font color="#FFD54A">Sinyal seluler di sini payah.</font>

00:23:06.218 --> 00:23:07.970
<font color="#FFD54A">Ya, ada di dinding sebelah sana.</font>

00:23:11.307 --> 00:23:12.099
<font color="#FFD54A">Hei, kemari, Beau.</font>

00:23:12.808 --> 00:23:15.018
<font color="#FFD54A">Beau, duduk. Anak pintar.</font>

00:23:15.019 --> 00:23:17.186
<font color="#FFD54A">Kaki. Berikan kakimu. Bagus.</font>

00:23:17.187 --> 00:23:19.856
<font color="#FFD54A">Hei. Aku di kandang bawah.</font>

00:23:19.857 --> 00:23:21.608
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku butuh derek.</font>

00:23:21.609 --> 00:23:24.277
<font color="#FFD54A">- Baterainya mati.
- Ya, ya. Anak pintar.</font>

00:23:24.278 --> 00:23:25.862
<font color="#FFD54A">Oke. Terima kasih.</font>

00:23:25.863 --> 00:23:26.946
<font color="#FFD54A">Duduk.</font>

00:23:26.947 --> 00:23:27.990
<font color="#FFD54A">Turun.</font>

00:23:28.574 --> 00:23:31.743
<font color="#FFD54A">Anak pintar.</font>

00:23:31.744 --> 00:23:34.037
<font color="#FFD54A">Berguling. Berguling. Berguling.</font>

00:23:34.038 --> 00:23:35.581
<font color="#FFD54A">Anak pintar.</font>

00:23:39.793 --> 00:23:41.503
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku melihatmu mengerjakan tes tadi.</font>

00:23:43.088 --> 00:23:46.175
<font color="#FFD54A">Ya, cuma semacam teka-teki otak.</font>

00:23:47.009 --> 00:23:48.259
<font color="#FFD54A">Begini...</font>

00:23:48.260 --> 00:23:51.305
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku pernah mengalami...</font>

00:23:52.222 --> 00:23:53.349
<font color="#FFD54A">cedera otak yang cukup parah.</font>

00:23:54.433 --> 00:23:55.434
<font color="#FFD54A">Maaf.</font>

00:23:56.852 --> 00:23:58.853
<font color="#FFD54A">- Aduh, seharusnya aku diam saja.
- Tidak, tidak.</font>

00:23:58.854 --> 00:24:00.396
<font color="#FFD54A">Tidak, kau memang perlu tahu. Bagus kalau dibicarakan.</font>

00:24:00.397 --> 00:24:02.274
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku memang seharusnya membicarakannya.</font>

00:24:03.651 --> 00:24:05.068
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku menemui terapis.</font>

00:24:05.069 --> 00:24:08.279
<font color="#FFD54A">Dia mencoba membantuku mengingat masa laluku.</font>

00:24:08.280 --> 00:24:11.199
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku tidak bisa mengingat sebagian besar.</font>

00:24:11.200 --> 00:24:12.242
<font color="#FFD54A">Sebenarnya, hampir tidak ada sama sekali.</font>

00:24:13.035 --> 00:24:14.536
<font color="#FFD54A">Sekarang aku cuma punya Beau.</font>

00:24:15.412 --> 00:24:16.538
<font color="#FFD54A">Cuma dia dan aku.</font>

00:24:18.457 --> 00:24:20.334
<font color="#FFD54A">Sekarang kau juga punya aku.</font>

00:24:24.171 --> 00:24:26.464
<font color="#FFD54A">Sini. Kita main satu permainan.</font>

00:24:26.465 --> 00:24:27.549
<font color="#FFD54A">Berikan tanganmu.</font>

00:24:39.103 --> 00:24:40.521
<font color="#FFD54A">- Pernah main?
- Belum.</font>

00:24:43.065 --> 00:24:45.025
<font color="#FFD54A">Kau harus lebih cepat.</font>

00:24:49.613 --> 00:24:51.447
<font color="#FFD54A">Curang.</font>

00:24:54.326 --> 00:24:57.538
<font color="#FFD54A">Sepertinya jemputanku sudah datang.</font>

00:25:00.541 --> 00:25:04.168
<font color="#FFD54A">Bagaimana kalau kutraktir minum di bar lokal?</font>

00:25:04.169 --> 00:25:07.088
<font color="#FFD54A">Ya, boleh juga.</font>

00:25:07.089 --> 00:25:08.340
<font color="#FFD54A">Jumat.</font>

00:25:29.611 --> 00:25:31.655
<font color="#FFD54A">- Siapa itu?
- Jellef!</font>

00:25:34.658 --> 00:25:37.369
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku butuh bantuanmu. Anjing-anjing lepas dari kandang.</font>

00:25:38.662 --> 00:25:39.662
<font color="#FFD54A">Ayo.</font>

00:25:42.541 --> 00:25:43.958
<font color="#FFD54A">Kurasa mereka memojokkan sesuatu.</font>

00:25:43.959 --> 00:25:45.168
<font color="#FFD54A">Tidak bisa menghubungi siapa pun di rumah utama.</font>

00:25:45.169 --> 00:25:46.794
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku benci hal seperti ini.</font>

00:25:46.795 --> 00:25:48.254
<font color="#FFD54A">Kalau begini terjadi, aku bisa gila.</font>

00:25:48.255 --> 00:25:49.423
<font color="#FFD54A">Hei. Kau dengar itu?</font>

00:25:53.886 --> 00:25:54.887
<font color="#FFD54A">Lewat sini.</font>

00:26:00.225 --> 00:26:01.477
<font color="#FFD54A">Oh, tidak.</font>

00:26:04.646 --> 00:26:05.981
<font color="#FFD54A">Tidak.</font>

00:26:08.609 --> 00:26:10.818
<font color="#FFD54A">Mungkin coyote, beruang, atau semacamnya.</font>

00:26:10.819 --> 00:26:13.196
<font color="#FFD54A">- Kau pikir mereka yang melakukan ini?
- Mungkin serigala. Entahlah.</font>

00:26:13.197 --> 00:26:15.449
<font color="#FFD54A">Dia kesakitan. Kita harus mengakhiri penderitaannya.</font>

00:26:32.174 --> 00:26:33.342
<font color="#FFD54A">Kau tahu cara menggunakannya?</font>

00:26:35.219 --> 00:26:36.553
<font color="#FFD54A">Nih, pegang.</font>

00:26:37.805 --> 00:26:39.223
<font color="#FFD54A">Ayo, ambil.</font>

00:26:40.265 --> 00:26:41.266
<font color="#FFD54A">Ambil.</font>

00:26:47.564 --> 00:26:48.565
<font color="#FFD54A">Kau bisa.</font>

00:26:49.775 --> 00:26:50.776
<font color="#FFD54A">Aku tidak bisa.</font>

00:28:10.480 --> 00:28:13.065
<font color="#FFD54A">Cara dia mengangkat pistol tadi... kukira dia akan menembakku.</font>

00:28:13.066 --> 00:28:17.862
