<font color="#FFD54A">Pengujiannya akan bergerak ke arah berbeda.</font>

01:29:06.841 --> 01:29:08.842
<font color="#FFD54A">Sangat berbeda.</font>

01:29:08.843 --> 01:29:10.011
<font color="#FFD54A">Dimengerti.</font>

01:29:15.433 --> 01:29:16.977
<font color="#FFD54A">Ya Tuhan.</font>

01:29:18.478 --> 01:29:20.479
<font color="#FFD54A">Berapa kali lagi kita harus melewati ini?</font>

01:29:22.983 --> 01:29:24.817
<font color="#FFD54A">Halo?</font>

01:29:24.818 --> 01:29:26.903
<font color="#FFD54A">Kau sudah menutup hampir semua jalurmu.</font>

01:29:28.697 --> 01:29:29.697
<font color="#FFD54A">Bay.</font>

01:29:29.698 --> 01:29:30.782
<font color="#FFD54A">Di mana Harris?</font>

01:29:31.449 --> 01:29:32.700
<font color="#FFD54A">Mati.</font>

01:29:32.701 --> 01:29:33.910
<font color="#FFD54A">Sekarang ini operasiku.</font>

01:29:35.161 --> 01:29:39.331
<font color="#FFD54A">Jadi datanglah, kita bicara langsung tanpa omong kosong.</font>

01:29:39.332 --> 01:29:41.001
<font color="#FFD54A">Kita bisa membereskan semuanya, oke?</font>

01:29:42.711 --> 01:29:43.712
<font color="#FFD54A">Di mana Gretchen?</font>

01:29:44.838 --> 01:29:47.716
<font color="#FFD54A">Gretchen? Ya, dia harus melanjutkan hidup.</font>

01:29:49.301 --> 01:29:52.762
<font color="#FFD54A">Riset ini ternyata terlalu berat baginya.</font>

01:29:53.722 --> 01:29:55.640
<font color="#FFD54A">Kau bohong. Di mana dia?</font>

01:29:56.683 --> 01:29:58.143
<font color="#FFD54A">Kau harus kembali, Bay.</font>

01:30:00.937 --> 01:30:02.564
<font color="#FFD54A">Kau harus menyelesaikan Level 5.</font>

01:30:03.815 --> 01:30:07.861
<font color="#FFD54A">Ya. Kalau begitu mari kita mulai Level 5.</font>

01:30:09.613 --> 01:30:13.241
<font color="#FFD54A">Mulai tanpa permintaan maaf.</font>

01:30:15.368 --> 01:30:17.202
<font color="#FFD54A">Dan mungkin tidak seperti yang kau bayangkan.</font>

